{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：11:00 2026-09-11 HKT</p>\n\n<p>51歲的1998年香港小姐冠軍向海嵐，近年積極經營社交平台轉型做KOL，近日她再度出招推介香港地道平民美食，極力介紹售價僅需20元的燒味飯。片中只見向海嵐一身便服毫無港姐架子，手捧熱辣辣的燒味飯盒直接在後巷大啖開餐，邊食邊大讚燒肉油香四溢，性價比極高，盡顯親民貼地一面。</p>\n<h2>向海嵐曾教內地旅客窮遊香港</h2>\n<p>向海嵐這次賣力宣傳香港美食，全因她早前拍攝的「0元一日遊」影片意外惹禍。當時她在片中教旅客如何在香港挑戰「零消費」遊玩，當中更示範在餐廳借免費熱水沖泡自攜咖啡等行為，隨即引發全網猛烈抨擊。大批網民痛批她身為公眾人物及昔日港姐冠軍，非但未能為振興本地經濟出一分力，反而公開教人「攞著數」兼窮遊，對本地餐飲及旅遊業形象造成負面打擊。</p>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐是1998年「四料冠軍」港姐。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/de65d4504f8693ae32a825981cfb2f3d/2023-11/anneheung_1664519800_2938527523387866038_1240362383.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐2018年回流轉型「商界女強人」，與友人合資7位數大搞珠寶生意。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/41b42e97970303fff75b35e9d02b1551/2023-11/anneheung_01.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐曾到上海做公關。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b0a972eb12d7dadac1fc16c8faf57d74/2022-10/011_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐一度成朱玲玲老公愛將。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a5e320761aafed0b1fcc7b9f9d739952/2025-08/675cd2dcgw1egjzhlnvb0j21kw12zwpe.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐近日現身街頭拍片，極力推介香港20元超值平價燒味飯。 \" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/68c7528965ac08f284c9f66976b1a11a/2026-09/VS----0_02_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐展示燒味店招牌叉燒及燒肉，確是份量十足。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/eaffbfb4df563d8be09dee015a0e7dbb/2026-09/VS----0_03_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐早前曾拍片示範「0元遊香港」，現時卻瘋狂推介香港美食，與之前態度判若兩人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5826f4e95321942ab24415a8751b8be9/2026-09/VS----0_06_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐介紹20元燒味飯盒，百分百是糧尾恩物。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a219fd12278c7a450e1ae3b29559ab76/2026-09/VS----0_18_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐放下明星身段，親自去買飯盒。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4943ce98bd90f10c904e1abb59acb497/2026-09/VS----0_25_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐接過熱辣辣的燒味飯盒，急不及待在後巷開餐，非常平民貼地。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3e3b5e5943af3598046513742597e9b1/2026-09/VS----0_55_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐與母親感情極好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c4ce1f0030c9798b4f7a255e30c5c0cf/2022-10/013_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐今年母親節，曾公開合照與母親慶祝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/844b0f7179acb0f4c26091b705b1fa9e/2026-07/ANNE_26_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐曾分享與母親合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/26a4b11a343d1cd4b7d208df7838e584/2026-07/ANNE_25_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐的媽媽保養不錯。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3af995c2c875db95bc985f5a85c704b5/2026-07/ANNE_27_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐去年曾在IG限時動態透露，母親不慎跌倒撞到頭部，要送醫檢查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2e97dd2bb878fe29dfd9d01a33530b2c/2025-03/PWaasQflProdqs_dIsANcd-1Hg0xbW6-yU02sclNNrE.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐侍母至孝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/055dd0f276fed8847f8951f0697ee10c/2026-07/ANNE_29_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐染上黑髮後，外表年輕不少。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4422bfbd4a1b5e94b590eb8f10026fe0/2026-07/ANNE_28_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐的母親氣質優雅慈祥。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c5b5fc20acbcacee0cdf20a44211042d/2026-07/ANNE_15_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐與母親送別愛犬。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/343ce27c5ef2e1b45af561b6d2425c28/2026-07/ANNE_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐早前透露愛犬Chloe離世。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/445eac35269d7e4f13debfd89f25b16b/2026-07/ANNE_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐不捨愛犬。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d915a28e4e2926e2b9d2845a490eb376/2026-07/ANNE_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐晒出與愛犬昔日的合照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/058b25cb68860210140c378fb2f02687/2026-07/ANNE_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐的愛犬Chloe在17歲當日離世。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4685e0f7dc05b6d3a5e420f8626331d3/2026-07/ANNE_10_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐非常有愛心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4ce6a4645e1e9eda80880e5db8b3983e/2026-07/ANNE_19_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐家中有不少寵物。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/649200891cf752221cb41fb59acbd176/2026-07/ANNE_21_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐今年初曾帶母親到內地體驗「新事物」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5c1cae6c1bd8f3a0f8f3aae9b2475b5c/2026-02/VS----0_01__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐安排母親到內地做健康檢查。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b01d4ece2e125e76c1363a09e28bba11/2026-02/1_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐了解體檢細節後，對中心先進的醫療設備讚不絕口。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d80fea9cf0f142f9c086701f43161fea/2026-02/4_10.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐對醫療中心的專業水平充滿信心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c00f8e88c66a4cc8d0e4b021cdfd88fb/2026-02/6_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐的媽媽完成體檢後，兩母女遊廣州歎美食。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/9cce8f5330d352b7b636ccdcbeb0a0d2/2026-02/VS----1_11__1.jpg\"/>\n<h2>向海嵐疑連環拍片改善形象</h2>\n<p>向海嵐近日疑火速連環推出新片全力「補鑊」，除了親民試食平價燒味飯，她早前更針對內地旅客的購物需求，拍片推介遊客必買的香港「老字號藥品」，直指價格比內地便宜一大截；隨後又轉戰大型連鎖美妝店，大讚護膚品齊全兼常有低至七、八折優惠。由當初教人分文不花的「零元窮遊」，火速變身為力推旅客消費的宣傳大使，網民指她前後態度可謂判若兩人。</p>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐是圈中出名的孝順女。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2c8e1508e80540fa396af78cf51104f4/2026-07/ANNE_31_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐近年轉型從商，創立自家珠寶品牌。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8609cd377790156517934b0c80cd0fde/2026-08/3627715689768261361_1240362383.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐1998年參加香港小姐獲得冠軍後入行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ea990f004e509b174d83a602a28d11a8/2022-10/001_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐是四料港姐。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4bf642f19b97570a74f639b9a6584586/2022-10/002_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"《無頭東宮》是向海嵐代表作之一。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/601e429f2bb33ae156162baa526abf7f/2022-10/04_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐於劇中做奸妃。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1d1dca030cbd3d46b804e8659f7378d4/2022-10/005_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"因為《楊貴妃》斷定她古裝美人的戲路。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/75fa599b2fe8cd922295cca4be4ba934/2022-10/PhE_XH_fDfJQnZdVixIcL1SfVy_oLUIys7yMFbO8jBU.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐古裝扮相可人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1263a6b38dfb4e6d30bd5ef17bb9e25f/2022-10/006%20%282%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"《鳳舞香羅》演技大爆發。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6ae3cc1885991ab554e47c13d85f1b66/2022-10/008_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"《金裝四大才子》又是觀眾集體回憶。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4fec98d4dc21218a5c86f817c3c127cd/2022-10/12_600.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐曾與古天樂合作。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2b18cd209038c05ed56dc1ee964da21b/2022-10/10_600.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向展鵬曾在社交網貼出與向海嵐的搭膊合照，令人揣測二人是否有親戚關係。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8e8c70e835a0b9450f8fad53e5a0d90e/2023-11/HEUNG_01.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"當時向海嵐與向展鵬還貼頭合照，似乎關係匪淺。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b6bac51d40706688fcbd31be1230bd1e/2023-11/HEUNG_05.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"向海嵐曾接受傳媒訪問時，親口否認為「向氏後人」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/468f76444def04fa0374eb14f899ea2c/2023-11/HEUNG_08.png\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-11T03:19:44.149673+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":516,"images":44,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}